{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge the labyrinth and survive\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>MAZE SURVIVORS</i> is a survivor-style action game where you battle endless swarms of enemies within a deadly maze and fight to endure against time itself. Take command of adventurers such as the Knight, Mage, and Ninja to earn experience and treasure, leveling up and selecting skills to forge your ideal party. Weapons evolve with growth\u2014longswords become mighty sacred blades, fireballs ignite into scorching magic bolts, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage is a labyrinth of interconnected rooms filled with enemies and bosses that test both strategy and reflex. Survive until the final moment to uncover the secrets hidden deep within the maze.<br><br>Even when the journey begins alone, courage will guide you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083630/extras/98100769eb9b1cb7d28a835cfbae7af9.avif?t=1762134221\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083630/extras/47a8676b090e8ef1fd79ec1a234483e8.avif?t=1762134221\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new allies and increase your firepower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083630/extras/7ba42252a68da915d71dc9ae12827656.avif?t=1762134221\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083630/extras/96b4d9350026187eb127494a7d9c72ae.avif?t=1762134221\" width=1560 height=878 /></s